    "body": "For some reason the video page was the one spot where tapping like or repost without an account showed a toast that just said \"no\" and left it at that. Everywhere else already had the login dialog wired up. This fixes that. You tap like, the login dialog opens, you sign in, and the like goes through — one intent, one flow, no second tap needed. The pending action sits in a ref and self-clears after it fires.",
